      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 9,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "狂風の亜神と呼ばれるズィズィーさん。\n王子さんの世界から来た彼女は、\nなんというか掴み所のない不思議なお姉さんだ。",
      "jp_sha256": "abe4345c1f15fd07122750ded6591e9029dfb398cfd57ecb4e9bc1fc87490e5e",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "광풍의 아신이라 불리는 즈지 씨.\n왕자 씨의 세계에서 온 그녀는,\n뭐랄까 종잡을 수 없는 신비로운 누나다.",
      "message_index_0based": 9,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 57,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b009-20261106-99345c75ed114c6d",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "e2645718ccdd497fd00dbf09723e340c8ebafbf5ec982dbf1a8b0bac4808ff6c:000002_7523394695366499673:g0:r56",
      "row_index_0based": 56,
      "serialized_row_index": 56,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "狂風の亜神と呼ばれるズィズィーさん。\n王子さんの世界から来た彼女は、\nなんというか掴み所のない不思議なお姉さんだ。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "c151dab1f69760b267db3f7800d53feea5d3b80153d7225571c00d9f7fae6ce5",
